Jenkins Build Triggers Simplified! 🚀
Want to automate your builds in Jenkins? Here are 3 powerful ways:

✅ Poll SCM
 Jenkins checks your Git repo at regular intervals.
 It builds only if changes are detected.
 🕒 Example: H/15 * * * * (every 15 mins)

✅ Build Periodically
 Trigger builds at scheduled times, regardless of changes.
 ⏰ Example: @daily or H 0 * * * (every midnight)

✅ Webhook
 GitHub/GitLab sends a push notification to Jenkins.
 Real-time build trigger — fastest & most efficient!

🔄 All roads lead to... automated builds!
Each of these triggers ultimately starts a Jenkins build job with code from your Git repo, followed by testing, packaging, or deployment.

💡 Pro Tip: Use Webhooks for fast builds + Poll SCM as a backup for reliability!
